    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34766" root="فوج" body-key="f">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسْتُ بِرَائِحٍ حَتَّى أُفَوِّجَ</span></b>  means [<i>I am not going
in the evening</i>] <i>until I refresh myself by the coolness of the air.</i> (K: there expl. by the words <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَىْ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُبَرِّدَ عَنْ نَفْسِى</span> [in which, for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُبَرِّدَ</span>, I read <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُبْرِدَ</span>]:
in some copies [erroneously] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَى نفسى</span>.)

